# Review plots: a symlink to the published copy under the user's EOS web area.
# Deliberately not tracked -- it is an absolute path that resolves only on
# lxplus, so committing it would dangle for anyone cloning elsewhere.  The
# plots live at https://oamram.web.cern.ch/collide_v2_review/ and on EOS at
# /eos/cms/store/group/phys_b2g/CASE/collide_v2/review_plots/
/review_plots
